      "text": "Name",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "vfs_linux_xfs_sgid — Workaround XFS sgid bit not inherited",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Synopsis",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "code",
            "text": "vfs objects = linux_xfs_sgid"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "DESCRIPTION",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This VFS module is part of the [[p0]] suite.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "link",
            "text": "samba(7)",
            "href": "https://www.samba.org/samba/docs/current/man-html/samba.7.html"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]] is a VFS module to work around an old Linux XFS bug fixed in 3.11: the SGID bit is not inherited during mkdir when a default ACL is set ([[p1]] fixed by [[p2]]). The [[p3]] VFS module will work around this bug by manually setting the SGID bit after a [[p4]] if the parent directory had the SGID bit set.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "code",
            "text": "vfs_linux_xfs_sgid"
          }
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "link",
            "text": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160320180937/http://oss.sgi.com/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=280",
            "href": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160320180937/http://oss.sgi.com/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=280"
          }
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "link",
            "text": "https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/commit/?id=42c49d7f249c2487f36d3314753d5d8ebcee8249",
            "href": "https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/commit/?id=42c49d7f249c2487f36d3314753d5d8ebcee8249"
          }
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p3]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "code",
            "text": "vfs_linux_xfs_sgid"
          }
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p4]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "code",
            "text": "mkdir"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This module is stackable.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "EXAMPLES",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Add linux_xfs_sgid functionality for [share]:",
      "protected": []
    },
